	'booking_lead' => 'Reserving a pitch or timber lodge at Nohara Holiday Park is handled directly by our reception team with clear terms and personal care.',
	'booking_lead2' => 'We hold reservations free for forty-eight hours while you confirm your plans, ensuring your dates are securely protected.',
	'booking_s1_h' => 'How a week is reserved',
	'booking_s1_p1' => 'Our booking process follows four simple stages: Ask, Hold, Confirm, and Arrive. First, ask for dates by telephone, email, or through our booking enquiry form, noting that weekly stays run from Saturday to Saturday. Second, Hana Kovač and our reception team place a free hold on your chosen pitch or lodge for 48 hours without payment.',
	'booking_s1_p2' => 'Third, confirm your reservation by paying a 25% deposit, after which we email your pitch or lodge allocation and park map within one working day. Finally, arrive at the park gate, where a warden greets you and walks you directly to your accommodation.',
	'booking_s2_h' => 'Payment terms and cancellations',
	'booking_s2_p1' => 'To confirm any stay, we require a 25% deposit upon booking. The remaining balance falls due four weeks prior to your arrival date. If your travel plans change, we provide free cancellation up to fourteen days before your scheduled arrival, returning your deposit without penalty. Bed linen and bath towels are included in all lodge bookings, and children under five stay free across the entire park.',
	'booking_s2_p2' => 'Guests aged five and over beyond the standard two adults on pitches are charged €6 per night. All transactions are billed in euros as stated on our fixed price ledger.',
	'booking_s3_h' => 'Ask for dates',
	'booking_s3_p1' => 'You can request your stay dates directly using our online enquiry form, by calling +00 31 6120 0841, or by emailing hello@nohara-park.example. In season, reception is open daily from 08:30 to 18:00; out of season, we are open daily from 09:00 to 16:00, closing only on 25 and 26 December.',
	'booking_s3_p2' => 'All telephone calls are answered during reception opening hours, and every written enquiry receives a personal response within one working day. Please include your preferred arrival date, number of nights, accommodation choice, and party size so we can reserve your space promptly.',
