	'pr_h2' => 'Prices and pitch rates',
	'pr_note' => 'Children under 5 stay free. A 25% deposit holds your booking; the balance is due 4 weeks before arrival. Free cancellation up to 14 days before arrival. Bed linen and towels are included in lodges.',
	'prices_c1_t' => 'Touring and tent pitches open for the season',
	'prices_c2_t' => 'Pitches close; the lodges stay open',
	'prices_c3_t' => 'Reception closed; open again on the 27th',
	'prices_h1' => 'Prices & dates',
	'prices_lead' => 'Transparent pricing and clear seasonal schedules govern all reservations at Nohara Holiday Park.',
	'prices_lead2' => 'Our eight fixed tariffs are listed in euros with no hidden additions, accompanied by clear terms and straightforward changeover hours.',
	'prices_s1_h' => 'Park calendar and seasons',
	'prices_s1_p1' => 'Our touring and tent pitches open for the season on 15 March and close on 2 November. Our fourteen timber lodges operate all year round, welcoming guests through both the active summer season and the quiet winter months from November to mid-March. Reception is staffed daily from 08:30 to 18:00 during the main season, and from 09:00 to 16:00 during the out-of-season period.',
	'prices_s1_p2' => 'The park office closes on 25 and 26 December. Reservations for pitch weeks during the upcoming season open annually on 1 December, allowing guests to organise their spring and summer stays well in advance.',
	'prices_s2_h' => 'Complete price list',
	'prices_s2_p1' => 'A gravel touring pitch with 10A hook-up costs €34 per night for two adults, a car, and a caravan or motorhome. A grass tent pitch for two adults and a car costs €24 per night. A full seven-night gravel pitch week from Saturday to Saturday is €210. A two-bed lodge sleeping four costs €690 per week, while a three-bed lodge sleeping six costs €860 per week.',
	'prices_s2_p2' => 'Short breaks in a two-bed lodge from Friday to Monday or Monday to Friday cost €380. Additional guests aged five and over cost €6 per night, while winter caravan storage from November to mid-March costs €320 for the season.',
	'prices_s3_h' => 'Booking conditions and hours',
	'prices_s3_p1' => 'Children under five stay free across all accommodation. A 25% deposit holds your booking, with the remaining balance due four weeks before arrival. Free cancellation is offered up to fourteen days before arrival. Bed linen and towels are included in lodges. For pitch guests, arrival begins at 13:00 and departure is by 11:00.',
	'prices_s3_p2' => 'For lodge guests, arrival begins at 15:00 and departure is by 10:00. Weekly reservations run Saturday to Saturday. Park quiet hours are observed from 22:00 to 07:00, and a speed limit of 8 km/h is maintained across all park roads.',
	'res_1_f' => 'Sat–Sat',
	'res_1_n' => '1',
	'res_1_t' => 'Ask',
	'res_1_x' => 'Choose dates by phone, email or the booking page; Saturday changeover.',
	'res_2_f' => '48 hours',
	'res_2_n' => '2',
	'res_2_t' => 'Hold',
	'res_2_x' => 'Reception holds the pitch or lodge for 48 hours, free of charge.',
	'res_3_f' => '25% deposit',
	'res_3_n' => '3',
	'res_3_t' => 'Confirm',
	'res_3_x' => 'Pay the 25% deposit; confirmation with your pitch or lodge number and a park map within 1 working day.',
	'res_4_f' => 'from 13:00',
	'res_4_n' => '4',
	'res_4_t' => 'Arrive',
	'res_4_x' => 'A warden meets you at the gate and walks you to your pitch; pitches from 13:00, lodges from 15:00.',
	'res_h2' => 'How a week is reserved',
	'res_p' => 'Pitches and lodges run on Saturday changeovers throughout the season. Choose your dates by phone, email, or through reception, and we will hold your booking for 48 hours free of charge while you arrange travel.',
	'se_1_h' => 'Hedges, drains and the oak wood',
	'se_1_m' => 'November – February',
	'se_1_p1' => 'When the pitches close on 2 November, Samir and the wardens begin the winter grounds work. They lay the hedge along Ash Hollow Lane, clear the drainage ditches and survey and coppice the trees of the oak wood.',
	'se_1_p2' => 'Hedge laying runs from November to December, drain and wash-house maintenance fills January, and the tree survey and coppicing follow in February.',
	'se_2_h' => 'Fresh gravel and thirty stored caravans',
	'se_2_m' => 'March',
	'se_2_p1' => 'Early March brings fresh gravel across the touring pitches before opening on 15 March. In the storage yard, Luca checks up to thirty stored caravans every week and airs them once a month.',
	'se_2_p2' => 'Winter caravan storage is €320 for the season, from November to mid-March, and collection is by appointment.',
	'se_h2' => 'What the wardens look after out of season',
	'se_link' => 'Out of season →',
